60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate C, Wetland Restoration, addresses the drainage and uses the fund.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, but the earth-moving for ponds is risky with the clay subsoil.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,"The upkeep cost for water management is high, but the fund covers the capital.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The volunteer group upriver is already doing habitat tasks. They could help here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The boardwalks provide firm ground for crossings, which the counts show people need.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The risk is manageable if we use shallow work, as the firms quoted.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,Shallow work is quoted at ordinary rates. That is a relief.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,"I am still worried about the long-term cost, but the fund helps.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,The volunteer support is a strong point for the wetland plan.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,The heat readings suggest we need more shade and water. This plan provides both.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for C. It aligns with the fund and the site conditions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I also vote for C. The phasing allows the park to stay open.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,I vote for C. The financial structure is the most sustainable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for C. The volunteer integration is key.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for C. It solves the drainage and heat issues.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
